<title>HUNGARY: Borsodchem plans 12pct dividend on 1996.</title>
<headline>Borsodchem plans 12pct dividend on 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Borsodchem said on Friday its management would propose paying a 12 percent dividend on the 1996 results, in addition to a 10 percent advance dividend paid earlier.</p>
<p>The chemicals company plans to pay the dividend on August 15, 1997, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company did not pay a dividend on the 1995 results but reinvested the money.</p>
<p>Borsodchem will hold its annual shareholders meeting on April 25.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
